  "description": "Find the maximum subarray sum allowing for at most one element deletion.",
  "pseudocode": "1. let n = arr.length\n2. let end0 = arr[0], end1 = 0, res = arr[0]\n3. for i = 1 to n-1:\n4.   end1 = max(end1 + arr[i], end0)\n5.   end0 = max(end0 + arr[i], arr[i])\n6.   res = max(res, end0, end1)",
